# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fractional gates on IBM QPUs {#fractional-gates-on-ibm-qpus}"
msgstr "Fractional Gates pada IBM QPU {#fractional-gates-on-ibm-qpus}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "Fractional gates are parameterized quantum gates that enable direct execution of arbitrary-angle rotations (within specific bounds),\n"
#| "eliminating the need to decompose them into multiple basis gates.\n"
#| "By leveraging the native interactions between physical qubits, users can implement certain unitaries more efficiently on hardware.\n"
msgid ""
"Fractional gates are parameterized quantum gates that enable direct execution of arbitrary-angle rotations (within specific bounds),\n"
"eliminating the need to decompose them into multiple basis gates.\n"
"By leveraging the native interactions between physical qubits, you can implement certain unitaries more efficiently on hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fractional gates adalah quantum gates berparameter yang memungkinkan eksekusi langsung rotasi sudut sembarang (dalam batas tertentu),\n"
"menghilangkan kebutuhan untuk menguraikannya menjadi beberapa basis gates.\n"
"Dengan memanfaatkan interaksi alami antara qubit fisik, pengguna dapat mengimplementasikan unitary tertentu secara lebih efisien pada perangkat keras.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; Heron QPUs support the following fractional gates:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ for $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$\n"
"- $R_X(\\theta)$ for any real value $\\theta$\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; Heron QPU mendukung fractional gates berikut:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ untuk $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$\n"
"- $R_X(\\theta)$ untuk nilai real $\\theta$ apa pun\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These gates can significantly reduce both the depth and duration of quantum circuits.\n"
"They are particularly advantageous in applications that rely heavily on $R_{ZZ}$ and $R_X$,\n"
"such as Hamiltonian simulation, the Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA), and quantum kernel methods.\n"
"In this tutorial, we focus on the quantum kernel as a practical example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gates ini dapat secara signifikan mengurangi kedalaman maupun durasi quantum circuit.\n"
"Keunggulannya terutama terasa pada aplikasi yang banyak mengandalkan $R_{ZZ}$ dan $R_X$,\n"
"seperti simulasi Hamiltonian, Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA), dan metode quantum kernel.\n"
"Dalam tutorial ini, kita fokus pada quantum kernel sebagai contoh praktis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations {#limitations}"
msgstr "Keterbatasan {#limitations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fractional gates are currently an experimental feature and come with a few constraints:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}$ is limited to angles in the range $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$.\n"
"- Using fractional gates is not supported for [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow), [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling), [probabilistic error cancellation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec) (PEC), and [zero-noise extrapolation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne) (ZNE) (using [probabilistic error amplification](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) (PEA)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Fractional gates saat ini merupakan fitur eksperimental dan memiliki beberapa batasan:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}$ dibatasi pada sudut dalam rentang $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$.\n"
"- Penggunaan fractional gates tidak didukung untuk [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow), [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling), [probabilistic error cancellation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec) (PEC), dan [zero-noise extrapolation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne) (ZNE) (menggunakan [probabilistic error amplification](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) (PEA)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fractional gates require a different workflow compared to the standard approach.\n"
"This tutorial explains how to work with fractional gates through a practical application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fractional gates memerlukan alur kerja yang berbeda dibandingkan pendekatan standar.\n"
"Tutorial ini menjelaskan cara bekerja dengan fractional gates melalui aplikasi praktis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the following for more details on fractional gates.\n"
"- [Fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates)\n"
"- [When *not* to use fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates#when-not-to-use)\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat referensi berikut untuk detail lebih lanjut tentang fractional gates.\n"
"- [Fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates)\n"
"- [Kapan *tidak* menggunakan fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates#when-not-to-use)\n"

