#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "1. Generate parameter values that satisfy the RZZ angle constraint {#1-generate-parameter-values-that-satisfy-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"
msgid "Workflow approaches for the RZZ angle constraint {#workflow-approaches-for-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"
msgstr "1. Buat nilai parameter yang memenuhi batasan sudut RZZ {#1-generate-parameter-values-that-satisfy-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "The workflow for using the fractional gates generally follows the [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow.\n"
#| "The key difference is that all RZZ angles must satisfy the constraint $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
#| "There are two approaches to ensure this condition is met.\n"
#| "This tutorial focuses on and recommends the second approach.\n"
msgid ""
"The workflow for using fractional gates generally follows the [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow.\n"
"The key difference is that all RZZ angles must satisfy the constraint $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
"There are two approaches to ensure this condition is met, as we discuss below. We recommend the second approach, and in this tutorial, we demonstrate it through an example inspired by the quantum kernel method.\n"
"To better understand where quantum kernels are likely to be useful, we recommend reading [Liu, Arunachalam & Temme (2021)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-021-01287-z).\n"
msgstr ""
"Alur kerja untuk menggunakan fractional gates umumnya mengikuti alur kerja [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns).\n"
"Perbedaan utamanya adalah semua sudut RZZ harus memenuhi batasan $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
"Ada dua pendekatan untuk memastikan kondisi ini terpenuhi.\n"
"Tutorial ini berfokus pada dan merekomendasikan pendekatan kedua.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "You can also work through the [Quantum kernel training](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) tutorial and the [Quantum kernels](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) lesson in the Quantum machine learning course on IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
msgid "You can also work through the [Quantum kernel training](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) tutorial and the [Quantum kernels](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) lesson in the Quantum machine learning course on IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa mempelajari tutorial [Quantum kernel training](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) dan pelajaran [Quantum kernels](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) dalam kursus Quantum machine learning di IBM Quantum Learning.\n"

