# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To assess the impact of fractional gates, we evaluate the number of non-local gates (CZ and RZZ for this backend),\n"
"along with circuit depths and durations, and compare these metrics to those from a standard workflow later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menilai dampak fractional gates, kita mengevaluasi jumlah gate non-lokal (CZ dan RZZ untuk Backend ini),\n"
"beserta kedalaman dan durasi Circuit, dan membandingkan metrik-metrik ini dengan workflow standar nanti.\n"

